# Environment Variables Configuration Guide
#
# To avoid the Railway BuildKit "failed to solve: secret not found" build-time daemon issue,
# do not assign variables directly in this example file.
# 
# Instead, configure the following variables directly in your Railway Service dashboard:
# 
# 1. OPENROUTER_API_KEY=your_key
# 2. GHANANLP_API_KEY=your_key (Optional: for local Twi/Ewe speech synthesis)
# 3. SENTINEL_HUB_CLIENT_ID=your_id (Optional)
# 4. SENTINEL_HUB_CLIENT_SECRET=your_secret (Optional)
